{"asset_key":"ep3/gameplay_story_13602160","episode":"ep3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"13602160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1360216001:1":{"text":"치열한 전투가 끝난 뒤, 열이 올랐던 두 사람도 어느 정도 진정이 되었다.","source_cn":"一场酣畅淋漓的战斗后，原本热血上头的二人总算多少冷静了下来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA27CB2E55A614FC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1360216002:1":{"text":"좋아요. 이제 두 사람 다 왜 싸우게 된 건지 제대로 설명해 줄 수 있겠죠?","source_cn":"好啦，你们两个，现在可以好好交代下到底为什么打架了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60CD30A705C60A05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1360216003:0":{"text":"저 꼬맹이가 먼저 습격했다!","source_cn":"这小子偷袭我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x407F6004E0D97439","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1360216004:1":{"text":"저쪽이 먼저 습격했어.","source_cn":"是他先偷袭。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0EA7DF096D2FA6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1360216005:1":{"text":"한 명씩 말해요! 샤키르, 당신부터요!","source_cn":"一个一个说！沙奎尔，你先说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71E2E7E868850C16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_sta